        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BTC30, Heavy Duty Ball Tension Catch</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLarge heavy duty ball tension catches are mostly used on cabinet doors where a high end appearance is required or for heavier duty applications than a magnet catch can handle. May also be used on furniture, cabinet doors, closets, or other lightweight doors. Easily adjustable tension and packaged with matching finish mounting screws. Made of solid brass they are available in 9 different finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BTC30-Specifications.gif?v=1704354544\" width=\"600\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BTC30  Ball Tension Catch\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-small-ball-tension-catch-deltana-btc10\"><b>Small Ball Tension Catch</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-medium-ball-tension-catch-deltana-btc20\"><b>Medium Ball Tension Catch</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\nSpecifications</b> for the Deltana BTC30 Ball Tension Catch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Base Max Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Base Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Tension</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BTC30.pdf?v=1691095270\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana BTC30 Dimension Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
