                "description": "Heavy Duty Ball Tension Catch Deltana BTC30 - Large heavy duty ball tension catches are mostly used on cabinet doors where a high end appearance is required or for heavier duty applications than a magnet catch can handle. May also be used on furniture, cabinet doors, closets, or other lightweight doors. Easily adjustable tension and packaged with matching finish mounting screws. Made of solid brass they are available in 9 different finishes.\r\n",
